@namespace Glory2Him.WebApp.Components.Pages.SamplePages.Shared

@* Placeholder article prose shared by the six post-single demos, so each of those pages carries
   only the chrome that actually distinguishes it. Presentational only (ts-ui-001). *@

<p class="lead">@Post.Excerpt</p>

<p>
    Traveling light is a discipline of trust. Every extra thing we carry is one more thing to
    guard, and the road has a way of showing us how little we truly need. The same is true of the
    heart — what we hold onto shapes how freely we can move.
</p>

<blockquote class="blockquote border-start border-3 border-primary ps-4 my-4">
    <p class="mb-2">
        "Cast all your anxiety on him because he cares for you."
    </p>
    <footer class="blockquote-footer mb-0">1 Peter 5:7</footer>
</blockquote>

<h3 class="h5 mt-4">What we learned along the way</h3>

<p>
    The best moments were rarely the ones we planned. They arrived in the gaps — a shared meal, an
    unhurried conversation, a morning where nothing was scheduled and everything mattered.
</p>

<ul>
    <li>Leave room in the day for the unplanned.</li>
    <li>Ask more questions than you answer.</li>
    <li>Write down the small things; they become the big ones.</li>
</ul>

@if (ShowTags)
{
    <hr class="my-4" />

    <div class="d-flex flex-wrap align-items-center gap-2">
        <span class="fw-semibold me-1">Tags:</span>
        @foreach (string tag in Tags)
        {
            <a href="Tag?name=@Uri.EscapeDataString(tag)" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary">
                @tag
            </a>
        }
    </div>
}
